id #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><strong>Information giving</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> regarding</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>How baby develops</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Nutrition</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>,</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> diet including vitamin D 10mg/ day.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Exercise, including Pelvic flo</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>or</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>A</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>ntenatal</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> screening.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Pregnancy care pathway.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Place of birth, Breast feeding.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>AN </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>classes</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>Maternity benefits.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><u><strong>Screening </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><u><strong>Tests</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>1. Blood </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>group</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> + Antibodies.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>2. Screening for Hemoglobinopathies.</span></p><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 72pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span