bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>           High performance</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>           chromatography</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:72pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>MCV &lt; 27 =&gt; High performance liquid chromatography</span></p><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 72pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Female carrier =&gt; check partner status.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Heel prick =&gt; neonate.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>3. Anemia, He</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>p</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> B, HIV, syphilis.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>4. Asymptomatic bacter</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>i</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>u</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>ri</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>a.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>5. Chlamydia \u2013 no test but information given</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> if age is </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>&lt; 25 years.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>6. Dating scan, 10 \u2013 13+6 weeks (CRL </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>up to</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> 84mm, then HC).</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>7. Height, weight, BMI, B.P, proteinuria, risk factor for P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>T</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>E, GDM.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'>8. Screening for down to all women.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'><em><strong>Combined:</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family:\"Calibri\", sans-serif;font-size:12pt'> 11 \u2013 13+6 weeks.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left